AFDE0B3"}, {"file_name": "Vinetra_Scrshot5.png", "id": "1698914684421545", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298150_1698914687754878_6550392051129348489_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Rg-QzLpSZ8Q7kNvwHdiSPT&_nc_oc=Adowl7dZWL_ldBEIApnBW6IKxxhEkdBPIKL4poiblI4dMBQQ1sOkBtH7dMgQm2bFNI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSHpeLNCz2m0icgnyILPakKT9b7GMD4I0_3RfYUiGgeGA&oe=6AFDB040"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vinetra: Multiplayer Survival", "keywords": ["survival", "multiplayer", "pvp", "roguelite", "gorilla"], "long_description": "# Vinetra: Multiplayer Survival\n\n\n**Features**\n\n\ud83c\udf32SURVIVE THE WILD\n- Physics based locomotion makes movement fun and engaging. Use your hands to run, climb, and survive in a large open world designed for movement.\n\n- Every life is a new attempt. Master the mechanics, learn the map, and survive longer than your last run. **Death is permanent**!\n\n\n\ud83c\udf92CRAFT & TRADE\n- Inventory management: Every slot matters. Balance your resources between food, tools & materials.\n\n- Sell & Trade for the weapons you need to survive the night. From primitive weapons to essential gear, your survival depends on what you can get.\n\n\u2694\ufe0f8 PLAYER BATTLES\n- You aren't alone. Compete or cooperate with up to 8 players in a free for all environment where placing full trust in someone can end in your demise.\n\n- Enemies are everywhere. Always be on the lookout for animals ready to kill.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0fEARLY ACCESS NOTE\n- **Vinetra is in early access.** Please expect bugs. Report them in-game, or in our Discord server, and help make Vinetra better for everyone!\n\n**How long can YOU last?**", "short_description": "Vinetra is a multiplayer survival game."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vineswingersgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_s